    "detail": "Pros: No additional charge for children, nice beach, not crowded, good sea view. The hotel is well maintained, and the cleanliness of the room is a big plus. The bed is comfortable. The toiletries used are from Malin+Goetz. The Thai restaurant has quite good flavor! The lifeguard at the pool is very attentive to the kids. Breakfast is also quite good! The infinity pool is not big but quite beautiful. Cons: The public areas of the hotel are too small for this price, and the room layout is winding and difficult to navigate. The corridors do resemble a guesthouse. It seems that you can't see the sea when lying on the beach chair. It's a bit far from D'Mall, not walkable.",
